# Docker Desktop on Windows can evaluate recursive patterns after walking a
# large directory. Keep the known top-level build-cache roots explicit so the
# modular root context stays source-sized.
# Windows Docker Desktop 有时先遍历递归目录再应用通配符；显式排除已知
# 顶层构建缓存根目录，确保模块化根上下文只发送源码。
platform/.tmp*
platform/.tmp*/*
agents/.tmp*
agents/.tmp*/*
frontend/.tmp*
frontend/.tmp*/*
sdk/.tmp*
sdk/.tmp*/*
adapters/.tmp*
adapters/.tmp*/*
**/.tmp-go-cache-final*
**/.tmp-go-cache-current*
**/.go-build-cache
**/.cache/go-build
**/.cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
# Explicit roots are required by Docker Desktop's WSL sender before its
# recursive ** matcher runs; otherwise Windows-created cache ACL/xattr entries
# can fail Linux-context builds before exclusion is applied.
# 显式根目录规则让 Docker Desktop 的 WSL sender 在递归 ** 匹配之前排除
# Windows 创建的缓存 ACL/xattr，避免 Linux 构建上下文在读取缓存时失败。
.pytest_cache
go-harness/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env_*
**/*.exe
docs
artifacts
tmp
**/tmp
**/tmp/**
**/*.out
**/*.prof
# Maven build outputs to keep out of build contexts; kept as explicit paths so
# the Go source package adapters/legacy-http/internal/target stays buildable.
# 需要排除的 Maven 构建产物；写成显式路径，避免误伤 Go 源码包
# adapters/legacy-http/internal/target。
agents/examples/java-spring-ai/target
sdk/java/agent-platform-sdk/target
sdk/java/agent-platform-spring-boot-starter/target
examples/java-tickets/target
**/.pnpm-store

# The modular Compose entrypoint builds only platform/, frontend/, agents/
# and sdk/.  Keep historical service trees out of the root context; legacy
# Compose files use their own historical contexts and are never part of the
# supported modular image build.
# 模块化 Compose 只构建 platform/frontend/agents/sdk；历史服务树不应进入
# 根构建上下文，避免 Windows Docker Desktop 发送无关源码、缓存和 ACL。
go-backend
go-harness
LexAgent
"LexAgent（20260826版）"
bak
**/bak
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.tox
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/models
**/checkpoints
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Native database exports contain business data and must remain private.
**/*.pgdump

# 固定模型权重只挂载到独立Provider，不进入源码或镜像上下文。
.local-models
